      { t: "open", q: "Do you think adults should encourage children to follow unusual dreams? Give ONE reason.", m: "Yes, I think they should, because a dream gives effort a direction, and children may discover talents they would never find if they gave up too early.", x: "تُقبل أي إجابة معقولة بجملة كاملة تتضمن رأياً وسبباً (يمكنك أن توافق أو تعارض بشرط أن تبرّر)." }
