      "**1. Introduction**",
      "The purpose of this report is to assess how well the school prepares students for their future careers and to suggest possible improvements. The information was gathered by means of a questionnaire completed by students in Grades 10 to 12 and short interviews with three teachers and the careers adviser.",
      "**2. Findings**",
      "**Careers advice.** Most students said that they had received advice only once, in Grade 12, which appears to be too late for many of them to change subjects. Several added that they would have welcomed ==being given== information about different jobs much earlier.",
